  "summary": "Malicious code in chai-as-core (npm)",
  "details": "Chai-as-core@7.0.8 executes remote code at module load. On require, lib/initializeCaller.js base64-decodes the URL hxxps://tomato-erminie-2[.]tiiny[.]site/index[.]json, fetches it over HTTP, and runs the response body as JavaScript via the Function constructor with the real require passed in, giving the remote payload full access to the Node.js runtime. The package is a trojanized clone of the pino logger with this loader injected; the C2/payload host is tomato-erminie-2[.]tiiny[.]site.",
